# The repository root ignores *.csv so nobody commits a participant file by
# accident. This directory's sample table is a fixture — test_skeleton.py reads
# it, and it is the file to drop on the server to see the interface work — so it
# is re-included here rather than by weakening the rule everywhere.
!sample_data/*.csv

# Drives written by turbotab/devchecks.py when TURBOTAB_DEV_CHECKS=1. Full
# request and response payloads, resolved state on both sides of every action,
# and a DOM snapshot per render — everything needed to reproduce a bug, and
# nothing anybody else needs. Temporary development instrumentation; the
# artifacts belong on the driver's disk and nowhere else.
sessions/
